	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "GCT RLP20 SPST-NO through-hole PCB relay, 3A-10A load variants (RLP20-xxLxxMFxx and RLP20-xxHxxMFxx). Four pins in asymmetric 2x2 array. Pin 1 (coil+) top-left, Pin 2 (coil-) bottom-left, both drilled Ø1.0mm. Pin 3 (contact common) top-right, Pin 4 (contact NO) bottom-right, both drilled Ø1.3mm. Coil-side column spacing 7.6mm vertical. Contact-side column spacing 7.1mm vertical, offset 2.54mm right of pin 3. Horizontal distance pin 1 to pin 3 = 12.7mm. Overall body 18.2x10.2x14.8mm (LxWxH). See Documentation/Components/RLP20-datasheet.pdf.")
